Changes made in the port
------------------------
* the upstream `local notation` for the algebraic closure and its automorphism group is
  removed and the types are written out;
* the upstream `p2m_export` commands and the `P2M.Util` import are dropped: this repository
  admits no code that runs at build time (no `#eval`, `run_cmd`, `initialize`, new `syntax`,
  `notation`, macros or elaborators);
* the upstream `private`/`_root_.CYT` two-layer naming is flattened into one namespace;
* the upstream private lemmas `isEisensteinAt_padicInt` and `irreducible_cyclotomic`, which
  derive `Irreducible (cyclotomic (p ^ n) ℚ_p)` by Eisenstein at `p` after `X ↦ X + 1`, are
  not reproduced: this repository already carries that theorem as Tau Ceti's
  `TauCeti.irreducible_cyclotomic_prime_pow_ratPadic`
  (`ZInQKernel/Contrib/TauCeti/NumberTheory/Cyclotomic/Irreducible.lean`; Tau Ceti,
  https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCeti commit 5a01f5fe3621, Apache-2.0, with its own
  notice preserved in that file);
* the upstream `IsSepClosedOfCharZero` route to a primitive `p^n`-th root of unity is replaced
  by Mathlib's `HasEnoughRootsOfUnity`;
* the proofs are adjusted from Lean 4.33 to Lean 4.35.0 / Mathlib 56a00585.

`InfiniteImage.lean` is original to this task: the upstream work contains no statement of it.
It uses the repository's own `ZInQ.Contrib.G9.PkgI4.cyc`, `cycPow` and `cpAct`.
